		(property "Description" "Replaces non-stock 2450CF15A0100001E (8-pin). Pulse Electronics coupler, 19dB/12.5dB coupling, 0202(0505 Metric) 4-pad. PIN COUNT DIFFERS from original 8-pin part - old footprint cannot be reused, needs new footprint + matching network re-verification. LINK BUDGET CHECKED: AMLGA7921 max TX 15dBm into AD8317 (accurate range approx -55 to 0dBm). MUST USE THE 19dB TAP -> 15-19=-4dBm, good margin. Do NOT use the 12.5dB tap -> 15-12.5=+2.5dBm, over AD8317 ceiling, worse than original 15dB single-tap part which was already at 0dBm with zero margin. Verify physical pin mapping for the 19dB tap before layout."
			(at 44.45 290.83 0)
			(hide yes)
